  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">He Manawa T&#x12b;t&#x12b; Scholarship: Fiji, Samoa, Tonga, Tuvalu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to provide leadership and experiential training to emerging leaders from Fiji, Samoa, Tonga and Tuvalu through a 12 week course delivered in Aotearoa New Zealand in early 2023.
This scholarship was announced by Minister Sio as part of the reparations suite accompanying the Dawn Raids apology in August 2021. The four countries included in this Activity were identified by the Minister as those of the communities most adversely impacted by the Dawn Raids.</narrative>
  </description>
